menu "NeuroEdge serial console (Q-79, TSK-I2f-10)"

    config NEUROEDGE_CONSOLE
        bool "Start the serial console"
        default y
        help
            The owner's way in with a USB cable: status, settings and secrets
            (a secret at a hidden prompt), the boot guard, reboot and factory
            reset. It starts in normal mode after the gate self-test, and is
            all that runs in safe mode. No command moves a pin or calls a tool.

    config NEUROEDGE_CONSOLE_STACK
        int "Console task stack (bytes)"
        default 4096
        range 3072 16384
        depends on NEUROEDGE_CONSOLE

endmenu
